{"version":1,"key":"card:773","content":{"id":773,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"野指针（Wild Pointer）是指不知道指向哪里的指针。和","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"悬空指针","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e86c2055-539d-47cd-82de-78c569d3dfd8","contentId":6140,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":772,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":"不同，悬空指针至少曾经指向过有效内存，而野指针从一开始就没有被赋予合法的地址。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4074c9ea-b82e-433c-9b74-8d0cec9ab087","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"最典型的情况是声明了指针变量但没有初始化，此时指针的值是栈上的随机垃圾数据：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b4c379da-5479-4cb6-860d-892c4592aabe","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"int main() {\n    int *p;     // 未初始化\n    *p = 10;    // 错误：p 指向哪里完全不知道\n}","collabId":"f5b7143d-d2ea-4dfc-8c70-8e00b47ee979","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"0bcfb43c-de6e-4366-a5db-2fa771e102c9","language":"C","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"599a2652-54d5-472f-b9c2-8037f6826f4f"},{"children":[{"text":"另一种是手动将指针赋值为某个任意地址，这同样极其危险：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f9548907-26ee-4f8c-a36c-442a6f111d75","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"int *p = (int*)0x12345678;\n*p = 10; // 极其危险","collabId":"e1bf97a9-433f-48b2-b3d7-f4e98f54ceb0","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"4b65c6d2-07d3-4509-9e93-7f02a25c9850","language":"C","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"79811e47-2783-4dd0-9257-ead451efecdb"}],"tags":["C","内存管理/野指针"],"createTime":1782913185239,"updateTime":1793532639797,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532639797},"links":{"card:772":{"key":"card:772","type":"card","id":772}}}